that given by the standard construction (3).
Given the Barth-Hulek theorem above we get a complete description of in-
stantons on S4 if it can be shown that the corresponding bundles over CP3
satisfy the vanishing conditions.
The condition that H0(E) = 0 is relatively easy to understand. From the
