constant section of the bundle E over S4 which means that the structure group
reduces to U(r −1). In view of the symmetry between E, E∗in the hypotheses
of the theorem the essential condition is H1(E(−2)) = 0. The reason that this
holds goes back to the origins of Penrose’s twistor theory.
Let Ω⊂R4 be an open set and eΩ⊂CP3 be the union of the corresponding
