+---
+id: thm-qftx-projective-gaga-for-monad-data
+kind: theorem
+title: "Projective GAGA for framed coherent and monad data"
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
